invariant: INV-7
file: srv.c
catches: webpki_loop_aes
reason: a host object's server whose caller did not set
  CH_CPU_CONSTANT_TIME_AES admits a caller's srv.cipher_suites list that
  names an AES-GCM suite, so it selects that suite for a client that
  offers it and keys AES-GCM traffic on instructions whose timing nobody
  stated. The ruling refuses such a list at init (docs/decisions.md 81
  and 89).
  test/webpki_loop_runtime.h's check_runtime_lists requires
  ch_srv_record_init to refuse each list the client refuses.

